---
layout: base.njk
title: Community Matters
description: Monitoring and commenting on significant planning applications in Wiveliscombe.
---

<header class="hero" data-variant="page">
  <h1>Community Matters</h1>
  <p class="lede">Monitoring and commenting on significant planning applications in Wiveliscombe.</p>
</header>

<section class="section flow">
  <section class="flow">
    <h2>Our Built Environment</h2>

    <p>Our aim is to work closely with our Town Council and Unitary Council to monitor, and, where necessary, comment on significant planning applications.</p>

    <p>Listed below are current planning applications within Wiveliscombe that we hope the community will appreciate being aware of.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="flow">
    <h2>Current Applications</h2>

    <div class="stack">
      {% for app in applications %}
      <article class="card">
        <h3><a href="/community-matters/{{ app.id }}/">{{ app.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ app.address }}</p>
        <p>{{ app.description }}</p>
        <p class="cluster" style="gap: var(--space-xs);">
          <strong>Ref:</strong> {{ app.reference }}
          <span>&middot;</span>
          <strong>Status:</strong> {{ app.status }}
        </p>
        {% if app.representation %}
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); border-inline-start: 4px solid var(--color-brand-300); padding-inline-start: var(--space-sm);">
          <strong>WCHS representation:</strong> {{ app.representation }}
        </p>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="/community-matters/{{ app.id }}/">More details</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
